{"v": 1, "kind": "explainer", "title": "How the Gravity Jet Suit flies (five-turbine version, schematic)", "primary": "solid", "notes": {"t1": {"basis": "F6, F7, F8 Wikipedia 2024 and ASME 2019"}, "t3": {"basis": "F5 Guinness 2019, F14 IE 2025, F9 Wikipedia 2024"}}, "board": {"v": 1, "items": [{"id": "cap", "k": "text", "at": [6, 7], "text": "Key figures"}]}, "solid": {"v": 2, "units": "mm", "params": {"input": 0, "explode": 0}, "parts": [{"id": "pilot", "use": "mannequin", "with": {"leftShoulder": 20, "rightShoulder": 20, "leftElbow": 0, "rightElbow": 0}}, {"id": "pack", "name": "Backpack (schematic)", "material": "plastic.muted", "parent": "pilot.back", "at": [0, 70, 0], "shape": {"box": {"size": [280, 140, 380]}}}, {"id": "rear", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 130, "length": 360, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pack", "at": [0, 140, 180], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "armL1", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 220, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.leftHand", "at": [0, 0, 120], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "armL2", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 220, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.leftHand", "at": [85, 0, 120], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "armR1", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 220, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.rightHand", "at": [0, 0, 120], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}, {"id": "armR2", "use": "microTurbojet", "with": {"diameter": 80, "length": 220, "cutaway": 0}, "parent": "pilot.rightHand", "at": [-85, 0, 120], "rot": [1, 0, 0, 180]}], "constraints": [], "annotations": {"labels": [{"id": "lVer", "at": {"part": "pilot.head", "offset": [0, 0, 250]}, "text": "Five-turbine Gravity Jet Suit, about 2018 onward", "unchecked": "F6 Wikipedia 2024"}, {"id": "lThrust", "at": {"part": "pilot.head", "offset": [0, -300, 120]}, "text": "Thrust, one arrow per turbine: 144 kg total, claimed", "unchecked": "F10 Gravity Industries 2020, claimed"}, {"id": "lSuit", "at": {"part": "pack", "offset": [0, 0, 300]}, "text": "Suit 27 kg before fuel", "unchecked": "F11 Wikipedia 2024"}, {"id": "lSteer", "at": {"part": "pilot.head", "offset": [0, -300, 0]}, "text": "Arm movement aims the thrust; no fins or nozzles move", "unchecked": "F15 Wikipedia 2024"}, {"id": "lTrig", "at": {"part": "pilot.rightHand", "offset": [0, -80, 0]}, "text": "Hand trigger throttle in the arm unit", "unchecked": "F16 ASME 2019"}, {"id": "lPack", "at": {"part": "pack", "offset": [0, 0, 260]}, "text": "Backpack: electronics, fuel system, rear turbine", "unchecked": "F18 ASME 2019"}, {"id": "lClass", "at": {"part": "armR1.mount", "offset": [0, -120, 0]}, "text": "Model-jet-style micro turbojet (example)", "unchecked": "Not confirmed Gravity hardware; F20 not published"}, {"id": "lImp", "at": {"part": "armR1.compressor", "offset": [0, -90, 0]}, "text": "Centrifugal compressor squeezes the air"}, {"id": "lComb", "at": {"part": "armR1.combustor", "offset": [0, -90, 0]}, "text": "Combustor: Jet A-1 kerosene or diesel burns", "unchecked": "F12 Interesting Engineering 2025"}, {"id": "lTurb", "at": {"part": "armR1.turbine", "offset": [0, -90, 0]}, "text": "Turbine drives the compressor on one shaft"}, {"id": "lNoz", "at": {"part": "armR1.exhaust", "offset": [0, -90, 0]}, "text": "Nozzle: hot gas leaves as a fast jet"}], "arrows": [{"id": "aT1", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armL1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "armL1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 20]}}, {"id": "aT2", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armL2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "armL2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 20]}}, {"id": "aT3", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armR1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "armR1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 20]}}, {"id": "aT4", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "armR2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 140]}, "to": {"part": "armR2.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 20]}}, {"id": "aT5", "meaning": "force", "from": {"part": "rear.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 180]}, "to": {"part": "rear.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 20]}}, {"id": "aW", "meaning": "force", "cause": "gravity", "from": {"part": "pack", "offset": [0, 0, -260]}, "to": {"part": "pack", "offset": [0, 0, -560]}, "text": "Weight of pilot, suit and fuel"}, {"id": "aSteer", "meaning": "force", "from": {"world": [-150, -350, 900]}, "to": {"world": [150, -350, 900]}, "text": "Side push toward the left (schematic)"}, {"id": "aAir", "meaning": "flow", "from": {"part": "armR1.intake", "offset": [0, 0, -80]}, "to": {"part": "armR1.exhaust", "offset": [0, 0, 90]}}]}}, "beats": [{"say": "A pilot wears five micro jet engines (schematic examples): two on each forearm and one behind the backpack. All the jets point down. The table gives the count.", "highlight": ["armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "rear", "t1.r1"], "ops": [{"op": "add", "item": {"id": "t1", "k": "table", "at": [6, 4], "header": true, "cells": [["Item", "Value"], ["Turbines", 5], ["Per arm", 2], ["Backpack", 1]]}}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["lVer"]}}, {"say": "Each engine throws hot gas down, and the gas pushes the engine up. In a hover the upward parts of the thrusts balance the weight of pilot, suit and fuel, and the turning moments balance.", "highlight": ["armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "rear"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "orbit": 30, "annotate": ["aT1", "aT2", "aT3", "aT4", "aT5", "aW", "lThrust", "lSuit"]}}, {"say": "To steer, the pilot moves an arm. The engines are fixed to the forearms, so the arm itself tilts their jets; no fins or nozzles move. Here only the right arm is raised.", "highlight": ["pilot.upperArmR", "armR1", "armR2"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "pose": {"pilot": {"with": {"leftShoulder": 20, "rightShoulder": 50, "leftElbow": 0, "rightElbow": 0}}}, "annotate": ["aT1", "aT2", "aT3", "aT4", "aT5", "aSteer", "lSteer"]}}, {"say": "A hand trigger in each arm unit sets the power. The backpack carries the electronics, the fuel system and the rear engine.", "highlight": ["pack", "rear", "pilot.handR"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "orbit": 150, "annotate": ["lTrig", "lPack"]}}, {"say": "Cut open one arm engine: air comes in, the compressor squeezes it, fuel burns with the oxygen in that air, the hot gas spins the turbine and leaves the nozzle as a jet.", "highlight": ["armR1.impeller", "armR1.combustor", "armR1.turbineWheel", "armR1.nozzle"], "view": {"section": {"normal": [0, -1, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["armR1.casing"]}, "focus": ["armR1"], "annotate": ["lClass", "lImp", "lComb", "lTurb", "lNoz", "aAir"]}}, {"say": "The shaft makes {armR1.input.speed} turn for each input turn. Compressor and turbine sit on that one shaft, so the turbine keeps the compressor turning.", "highlight": ["armR1.shaft", "armR1.impeller", "armR1.turbineWheel"], "check": [{"value": "armR1.input.speed", "eq": 1}], "view": {"spin": 1, "section": {"normal": [0, -1, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["armR1.casing"]}, "focus": ["armR1"], "annotate": ["lImp", "lTurb"]}}, {"say": "Published figures for this suit: its speed record, a typical flight time and its total power. They come from the sources, not from this model.", "highlight": ["t3.r1", "t3.r2", "t3.r3"], "ops": [{"op": "remove", "id": "t1"}, {"op": "add", "item": {"id": "t3", "k": "table", "at": [6, 4], "header": true, "cells": [["Item", "Value"], ["Record mph", 85.06], ["Flight min", 3], ["Power bhp", 1050]]}}], "view": {"camera": "hero", "annotate": ["lVer"]}}, {"say": "What this model does not show: thrust values, airflow, combustion and fuel lines are not modelled, and the engine sizes are schematic because the real turbine maker is not published.", "highlight": ["armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "rear"], "view": {"camera": "hero", "orbit": 60, "annotate": ["lClass"]}}]}